    "semanticRules": [
      "immutable revision以`PK(subject_id,material_key,binding_revision)`保存",
      "完整Physical Identity必须逐字节满足materialKey公式且size为non-negative safe integer",
      "每个`subject+material+role`只有一个current row",
      "Handoff A为每个Primary Manifest member建立`primary_control` Binding并逐项复制`CandidatePrimaryMaterialDelivery@1`，同时为每个Related Reference建立`related_derived` Binding并逐项复制同一Delivery Snapshot的exclusive association/disposition basis",
      "两种variant严格互斥，related variant的Primary/association/disposition列全非NULL且不得携带Control revision",
      "不得从current Field补读或默认",
      "不能为多Episode复制Binding或把Episode拼入字符串"
    ],
    "rawContract": {
      "columns": "`subject_id FK, material_key, role, authority_kind(primary_control|related_derived), primary_material_key NULL, association_evidence_digest NULL, disposition_basis_digest NULL, mount_scope_id, inode, fingerprint_algorithm, fingerprint_version, content_fingerprint, size_bytes, endpoint_id, location, binding_revision, health_state, evidence_digest, origin_intake_decision_id FK, origin_offer_id, origin_candidate_package_id, origin_package_revision, origin_package_digest, origin_candidate_delivery_snapshot_digest, origin_related_reference_set_digest, origin_related_disposition_scope_digest, current`",
      "constraints": "immutable revision以`PK(subject_id,material_key,binding_revision)`保存；完整Physical Identity必须逐字节满足materialKey公式且size为non-negative safe integer；每个`subject+material+role`只有一个current row；Handoff A为每个Primary Manifest member建立`primary_control` Binding并逐项复制`CandidatePrimaryMaterialDelivery@1`，同时为每个Related Reference建立`related_derived` Binding并逐项复制同一Delivery Snapshot的exclusive association/disposition basis；两种variant严格互斥，related variant的Primary/association/disposition列全非NULL且不得携带Control revision；不得从current Field补读或默认；不能为多Episode复制Binding或把Episode拼入字符串"
    },
